# Scacelith - Português (Portugal)
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other (1 is singular,
# 0 takes the plural).
# Register: European Portuguese software usage (Microsoft/Apple pt-PT): formal and impersonal,
# imperative in the formal 3rd person ("Selecione", "Prima"), "o seu / a sua", never the pronoun
# "você"; buttons and menu entries in the infinitive ("Jogar", "Guardar"). Spelling: 1990 agreement.
# Chess terms follow the pt glossary (dama, lance, xeque, afogamento, folha de registo...).

